    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-honda-dichotomous-tree-branching-repro-package-2> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "1976-honda-dichotomous-tree-branching.py L1840–L1882" ;
        dcterms:description "CLI entrypoint rendering comparison PNG, growth GIF, solar tier-spacing PNG and solar shadows GIF deterministically" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/028758bc/1976-honda-dichotomous-tree-branching.py#L1840-L1882> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-honda-dichotomous-tree-branching-repro-package-3> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "docs/media/dichotomous_tree_branching_solar_shadows.gif (generated output)" ;
        dcterms:description "13-frame equinox-day shadow animation, equator vs Meise — docs/media/dichotomous_tree_branching_solar_shadows.gif: rendered output of 1976-honda-dichotomous-tree-branching.py at 028758bc, image/gif, 228923 B, 960×480 px, 13 frames, artifact_sha256 b4a1e91a273726265045c60b5c655d6cac66170a60a39165fb5daa544b30cc80 (sha256 b4a1e91a273726265045c60b5c655d6cac66170a60a39165fb5daa544b30cc80), spec_fingerprint 7cfa8b501a15c214e965ecf451b63af5fa8b3bb7f3a5e144483628cccc87fe3b" .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-honda-dichotomous-tree-branching-repro-package> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Honda (1971) J. Theor. Biol. & Honda & Fisher (1978) Science 3D recursive dichotomous tree branching, effective leaf area optimization, Leonardo da Vinci pipe-model area conservation, and solar-elevation ray tracing of tiered crowns vs latitude — Reproducibility package: 93/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "10-suite `self_test()` (L1742-1838) verifies SHA-256 dataset integrity, Honda tip doubling and internode sum, Leonardo conservation, Honda & Fisher optimization vs ablation, benchmark Pearson r > 0.995, archetype aspect ordering, specimen CV invariants, and Pass 3 solar geometry (90 - phi zenith, Cooper delta(172) = 23.45, day lengths 12 h / 16.31 h), ray-tracer limits (E(tau_c = 1) = 1, E(opaque) < E < 1, E(s -> inf) = 1), s_90 monotonicity in latitude, specimen s/R in [0.2, 0.6], and bitwise determinism over 16 measurements; it passes in 13 s. Default render produces all four media files in ~7 s with no RNG. Deductions: self-test runtime grew from ~3 s to 13 s because two `measure_morphoeval()` calls each run the full latitude sweep (-2); the growth GIF (`k_tier = min(frame, 4)`, L1507) is unchanged Pass 2 content and the Pass 3 mechanism appears only in the new PNG/GIF (-2); hash pinning is split across two tables and the new bib is unpinned (-1); `*.png` is gitignored so the primary output is not tracked (-1); panel titles in the comparison figure still overlap (pre-existing cosmetics) (-1)." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-repro-package> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/repro-package" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "1976-honda-dichotomous-tree-branching.py L1507–L1507: Growth GIF tier schedule unchanged from Pass 2; Pass 3 mechanism not in the primary GIF <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/028758bc/1976-honda-dichotomous-tree-branching.py#L1507-L1507>",
            "docs/media/dichotomous_tree_branching_growth.gif (generated output, not in repo): Regenerated growth GIF; content unchanged from Pass 2 (tier schedule capped at 4), Pass 3 mechanism absent — docs/media/dichotomous_tree_branching_growth.gif: rendered output of 1976-honda-dichotomous-tree-branching.py at 028758bc, image/gif, 329685 B, 1056×505 px, 7 frames, artifact_sha256 8c1d43d9d3ebb6838293b16d7a81b7e511792600a6a70fa008114d064c6b3ce3 (sha256 8c1d43d9d3ebb6838293b16d7a81b7e511792600a6a70fa008114d064c6b3ce3), spec_fingerprint 7cfa8b501a15c214e965ecf451b63af5fa8b3bb7f3a5e144483628cccc87fe3b" ;
        pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-honda-dichotomous-tree-branching-repro-package-1>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-honda-dichotomous-tree-branching-repro-package-2>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-honda-dichotomous-tree-branching-repro-package-3> ;
        pk:hasScore "0.93"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

